<title>PHILIPPINES: Uniwide unit to build mall in Baguio city.</title>
<headline>Uniwide unit to build mall in Baguio city.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniwide Sales Realty and Resources Corp, a subsidiary of Uniwide Holdings Inc, said on Tuesday it will build a shopping complex on a 3.3-hectare property in the mountain resort city of Baguio.</p>
<p>The 1.7-billion peso complex will be built under a design-build-lease arrangement with the city government, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
